If a clinician uses an opioid-risk-assessment-tool then the clinician should supplement the opioid-risk-assessment-tool with a patient-discussion and should supplement the opioid-risk-assessment-tool with a family-member-discussion and should supplement the opioid-risk-assessment-tool with a caregiver-discussion and should supplement the opioid-risk-assessment-tool with a clinical-record and should supplement the opioid-risk-assessment-tool with a state-PDMP-record and should supplement the opioid-risk-assessment-tool with a toxicology-screening-data.
